      "comment": "this artwork is made of\n- black text and pink text\n- a very pale photo of a face, with colorful details\n- a rich multicolor background that goes red -> orange -> yellow -> green -> cyan -> dark blue -> pink\n\nthe Yoshi green background works very well, the Magentarama pink accent seems to be a close match for the pink text. But \n- i'm expecting a gradient background, like in the artwork\n- the indigo ink blue foreground does not match the artwork (in the artwork this blue is used as part of the background gradient, and the other available foreground text is black)",
      "submittedAt": "2026-07-26T14:10:04.025Z"
    },
    {
